File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1161
Function: pythonEntityDecl
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyObject_CallMethod uses format "sisss" with publicId, systemId, and content. In libxml2, these can be NULL for certain entity types (e.g., external entities have NULL content). Using "s" with NULL crashes CPython.

